# Roteiro de validação manual da Clinics API (VS Code REST Client)
# Suba a API com `make run` e execute as requisições em sequência.
# Substitua os IDs capturados das respostas anteriores onde indicado.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Contrato OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.yaml

### ─────────────────────────── Clínicas ───────────────────────────

### Criar clínica (CNPJ com máscara)
# @name createClinic
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "11.222.333/0001-81",
  "legal_name": "Clínica Sorriso LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Sorriso Odonto"
}

### Criar clínica com dados bancários e CNPJ alfanumérico
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "12.ABC.345/01DE-35",
  "legal_name": "Odonto Prime LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Odonto Prime",
  "bank_account": { "bank": "341", "agency": "0001", "account": "12345-6" }
}

### Documento duplicado → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "11222333000181",
  "legal_name": "Cópia LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Cópia"
}

### Documento inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "11.222.333/0001-99",
  "legal_name": "Inválida LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Inválida"
}

### Listar clínicas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics

### Buscar clínica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}

### Alterar dados cadastrais
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legal_name": "Clínica Sorriso Aberto LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Sorriso Aberto"
}

### Definir/alterar dados bancários
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/bank-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank": "260",
  "agency": "0001",
  "account": "98765-4"
}

### ─────────────────────────── Dentistas ──────────────────────────

### Criar dentista (admin e responsável legal)
# @name createDentist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dra. Ana Souza",
  "phone": "(11) 98765-4321",
  "email": "ana@sorriso.com.br",
  "admin": true
}

### Listar dentistas da clínica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists

### Buscar dentista
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists/{{createDentist.response.body.id}}

### Alterar dentista
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists/{{createDentist.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dra. Ana Souza Lima",
  "phone": "11 3265-4321",
  "email": "ana.lima@sorriso.com.br",
  "admin": true
}

### Email inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Erro",
  "phone": "(11) 98765-4321",
  "email": "sem-arroba"
}

### ─────────────────────────── Pagamentos ─────────────────────────

### Criar cobrança pix (R$ 150,00 em centavos)
# @name createPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinic_id": "{{createClinic.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 15000,
  "dentist_id": "{{createDentist.response.body.id}}"
}

### Acompanhar a cobrança — repita: pending → approved em 2–5s
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{createPayment.response.body.id}}

### Histórico de cobranças da clínica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/payments

### Valor inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinic_id": "{{createClinic.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 0
}

### ─────────────────────── Soft delete e cascata ──────────────────

### Excluir dentista (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}/dentists/{{createDentist.response.body.id}}

### Excluir clínica (soft delete + cascata nos dentistas)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}

### Clínica excluída some da API → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics/{{createClinic.response.body.id}}

### Cobrança para clínica excluída é rejeitada → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinic_id": "{{createClinic.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### O documento fica liberado para recadastro após o soft delete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clinics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "11.222.333/0001-81",
  "legal_name": "Sorriso Renovado LTDA",
  "trade_name": "Sorriso Renovado"
}
